<task id="080" project="spaarke-modal-system">
  <metadata>
    <title>P6 — WizardShell light-first re-base on SprkModal tokens + window controls — FR-17</title>
    <phase>6 Wizards</phase>
    <gate>blocked until 003,008</gate>
    <status>completed</status>
    <rigor>FULL</rigor>
    <rigor-reason>Modifies a shipped shared-lib `.tsx` (`WizardShell`) consumed by every `Create*`/direct wizard plus the iframe web-resource builds — high blast radius, so correctness + consumer/build verification are load-bearing (FULL trigger: modifying `.tsx`, tags include `fluent-ui`).</rigor-reason>
    <model-tier>sonnet</model-tier>
    <model-tier-reason>Bounded token/size/glyph alignment on an existing component with a clear reference (the shipped `SprkModal` header/footer tokens + the `WizardModal` preset); no architecture decision this pass.</model-tier-reason>
    <effort>high</effort>
    <parallel-group>none</parallel-group>
    <parallel-safe>false</parallel-safe>
    <parallel-reason>High blast radius — `WizardShell` is consumed by all `Create*`/direct wizards and by the iframe web-resource builds; a token/size change ripples to every consumer at once. Author and run solo, not in a parallel wave.</parallel-reason>
    <deps>003,008</deps>
    <tags>react, fluent-ui, frontend</tags>
    <estimated-effort>3-4 hours</estimated-effort>
