  <prompt>Do a LIGHT-FIRST re-base of `Wizard/WizardShell.tsx`: adopt the `SprkModal` standard header/footer + size tokens and the reconciled `ModalWindowControls` (task 003 `FullScreenMaximize/Minimize` glyph), and align the shell to the named `wizard` size. RETAIN the existing WizardShell envelope + `embedded` mode + the 200px stepper — this pass is chrome-token alignment only; do NOT perform a full internal re-base onto `SprkModal` (owner decision §11-G, light-first). All `Create*`/direct wizards inherit the aligned chrome; explicitly VERIFY the iframe web-resource builds are unaffected (FR-17).</prompt>
  <role>SPAARKE platform developer. Expert in Fluent UI v9, shared-lib wizard chrome, and dual-React (18/19) component maintenance. Follow ADRs strictly.</role>
  <goal>`Wizard/WizardShell.tsx` renders the standard `SprkModal` header (title + `ModalWindowControls` with the FullScreen glyph) and standard footer tokens, sized to the named `wizard` size, while keeping the WizardShell Dialog envelope, `embedded` mode, and stepper intact; all consuming wizards and the iframe web-resource builds compile green under `@types/react` 18 and React 19.</goal>

  <context>
    <background>Design §6.4 + spec FR-17 lock a LIGHT-FIRST wizard re-base: align WizardShell's header/footer/size tokens and window controls to the canonical `SprkModal` standard without dismantling the wizard-specific envelope. The owner chose this depth explicitly (Decisions Confirmed §11-G, 2026-08-01) — a deeper internal re-base is deferred as a separate decision. `WizardShell` today is a Fluent `Dialog` + 200px stepper + `embedded` mode with a Fluent sizing-clamp fix (default maxWidth 95vw / height 70vh); this task retargets it to the shared header/footer tokens and the `wizard` named size so the ~13-dialog family shares one chrome. It depends on 003 (the reconciled `FullScreenMaximize/Minimize` glyph) and 008 (the `SprkModal` base + `WizardModal` preset that supply the canonical header/footer/size tokens).</background>
    <relevant-files>
      <file role="modify">src/client/shared/Spaarke.UI.Components/src/components/Wizard/WizardShell.tsx</file>
      <file role="canonical-reference">src/client/shared/Spaarke.UI.Components/src/components/SprkModal/presets/WizardModal.tsx</file>
      <file role="reference">src/client/shared/Spaarke.UI.Components/src/components/SprkModal/sizes.ts</file>
      <file role="reference">src/client/shared/Spaarke.UI.Components/src/components/ModalWindowControls/ModalWindowControls.tsx</file>
      <file role="reference">c:/code_files/spaarke-prototype/projects/2026-07-sprk-modal-system/src/components/presets.tsx</file>
    </relevant-files>
    <dependencies>
      <dependency task="003" status="pending">Reconciled `ModalWindowControls` FullScreenMaximize/Minimize glyph.</dependency>
      <dependency task="008" status="pending">`SprkModal` base + `WizardModal` preset supplying the canonical header/footer/size tokens.</dependency>
    </dependencies>
  </context>

  <constraints>
    <constraint source="ADR-012">Change stays in the single shared `@spaarke/ui-components` copy of `WizardShell`; MUST NOT fork it or clone the shell per solution (CLAUDE.md §11 — compose, don't fork).</constraint>
    <constraint source="ADR-021">Fluent v9 semantic tokens only for the re-based header/footer chrome; MUST NOT introduce hex, `'1px'` literals, or inline color styles (strengthens ADR-021 / NFR-03).</constraint>
    <constraint source="project">LIGHT-FIRST scope: RETAIN the WizardShell Dialog envelope + `embedded` mode + the 200px stepper. Align only header/footer/size tokens + window controls to the `SprkModal` standard and the `wizard` named size. MUST NOT re-base the wizard internals onto `SprkModal` this pass (owner §11-G).</constraint>
    <constraint source="project">Keep OOB `navigateTo` untouched for full main-form editing; this task changes only the custom WizardShell chrome (NFR-05, client-only).</constraint>
    <constraint source="project">MUST compile clean under `@types/react` 18 (PCF) and React 19 (Code Pages) (NFR-04); the iframe web-resource builds MUST remain green.</constraint>
  </constraints>

  <knowledge>
    <topic>Light-first re-base of a shared-lib wizard shell onto SprkModal chrome tokens</topic>
    <files>
      <file>projects/spaarke-modal-system/spec.md</file>
